  <section class="wrap mx-auto max-w-3xl py-20 text-center md:py-28">
    <p class="eyebrow">Creative Direction</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-5xl md:text-6xl">Behind the lens.</h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-7 max-w-xl text-base leading-8 text-charcoal/75">Our work is led by Umair Khan, Founder &amp; Creative Director of MS Studio. Discover the vision and approach behind our wedding stories.</p>
    <p class="mt-9"><a href="/founder/" class="btn btn-solid">Meet Our Founder</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
